#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randn.rst:2
msgid "randn"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:1
msgid ""
"Returns a tensor filled with random numbers from a normal distribution "
"with mean 0 and variance 1 (also called the standard normal "
"distribution)."
msgstr "平均0、分散1の正規分布（標準正規分布とも呼ばれます）に従う乱数で埋められたテンソルを返します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:4
msgid ""
"Unlike :func:`torch.randn`, if the seed is fixed with "
":func:`qfeval_functions.random.seed`, the result must be reproducible on "
"any device because random numbers are generated by a device-independent "
"random number generator.  If the seed is set with ``fast=True``, this "
"function falls back to :func:`torch.randn` for speed at the cost of such "
"reproducibility."
msgstr ""
":func:`torch.randn` と異なり、:func:`qfeval_functions.random.seed` "
"でシードを固定した場合、乱数はデバイスに依存しない乱数生成器によって生成されるため、結果はどのデバイスでも再現可能です。``fast=True``"
" でシードを設定した場合、この関数は速度を優先して :func:`torch.randn` にフォールバックし、この再現性は保証されなくなります。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randn.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:12
msgid "A sequence of integers defining the shape of the output tensor."
msgstr "出力テンソルの形状を定義する整数のシーケンス。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:15
msgid ""
"The desired data type of the returned tensor. Default is "
"``torch.float32``."
msgstr "返されるテンソルの望ましいデータ型。デフォルトは ``torch.float32`` です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:19
msgid ""
"The desired device of the returned tensor. Default uses the current "
"device."
msgstr "返されるテンソルの望ましいデバイス。デフォルトは現在のデバイスを使用します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randn.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:23
msgid "A tensor of the given shape filled with standard normal random numbers."
msgstr "標準正規乱数で埋められた、指定された形状のテンソル。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.randn.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:28
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:30
msgid ""
">>> import qfeval_functions\n"
">>> with qfeval_functions.random.seed(1):\n"
"...     x = QF.randn(2, 3)\n"
">>> x\n"
"tensor([[ 2.0468, -1.0365,  0.7300],\n"
"        [ 0.4158, -0.1923, -0.4909]])"
msgstr ">>> import qfeval_functions\n>>> with qfeval_functions.random.seed(1):\n...     x = QF.randn(2, 3)\n>>> x\ntensor([[ 2.0468, -1.0365,  0.7300],\n        [ 0.4158, -0.1923, -0.4909]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:37
msgid ":func:`randn_like`: Normal random tensor with the shape of another tensor."
msgstr ":func:`randn_like`: 別のテンソルと同じ形状の正規乱数テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:39
msgid ":func:`rand`: Uniform random numbers on the interval [0, 1)."
msgstr ":func:`rand`: 区間 [0, 1) 上の一様乱数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.randn.randn:40
msgid ":func:`randint`: Uniform random integers."
msgstr ":func:`randint`: 一様なランダム整数。"

